    { id: 'observe', label: 'observe', sub: 'tail, await, trace', col: 1, row: 0, state: 'active' },
    { id: 'cancel', label: 'cancel', sub: 'whole tree, no orphans', col: 1, row: 1 },
    { id: 'reap', label: 'reap', sub: 'exit + output, one type', col: 2, row: 0 }
  ]}
  edges={[['spawn', 'observe'], ['spawn', 'cancel'], ['observe', 'reap'], ['cancel', 'reap']]}
/>

## Non-goals

New job kinds or scheduling policy; this is the contract for what already
exists.

